        "answer": {
          "short": "Range: Train: $4.2$; Bus: $2.9$.",
          "worked": "Train:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range}&=33.4-29.2\\\\\\text{Range}&=4.2\\end{align*}$$\n\nBus:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Range}&=32.1-29.2\\\\\\text{Range}&=2.9\\end{align*}$$",
