        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Mean: Train: $\\frac{472.6}{15}\\approx31.51$; Bus: $\\frac{368.3}{12}\\approx30.69$.",
          "worked": "The $15$ Train values total $472.6$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\bar{x}_{\\text{Train}}&=\\frac{472.6}{15}\\\\\\bar{x}_{\\text{Train}}&=31.50\\overline{6}\\\\\\bar{x}_{\\text{Train}}&\\approx31.51\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe $12$ Bus values total $368.3$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\bar{x}_{\\text{Bus}}&=\\frac{368.3}{12}\\\\\\bar{x}_{\\text{Bus}}&=30.691\\overline{6}\\\\\\bar{x}_{\\text{Bus}}&\\approx30.69\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
      },
      {
        "id": "p65-q9-mode",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "",
        "prompt": "Mode:",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Mode: Train: $32.0$ and $33.2$; Bus: $30.1$.",
          "worked": "Train: $32.0$ and $33.2$ each occur twice; all other values occur once. Both are modes.\n\nBus: $30.1$ occurs twice; all other values occur once. The mode is $30.1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 10
      },
      {
        "id": "p65-q9-median",
        "type": "part",
