        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Median: Train: $31.5$ (8th value); Bus: $\\frac{30.5+30.8}{2}=30.65$.",
          "worked": "Read each dataset in ascending order.\n\nTrain:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Position}&=\\frac{15+1}{2}\\\\\\text{Position}&=8\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe 8th value is $31.5$, so the median is $31.5$.\n\nBus:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Position}&=\\frac{12+1}{2}\\\\\\text{Position}&=6.5\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe 6th and 7th values are $30.5$ and $30.8$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{30.5+30.8}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=30.65\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 34
