        "answer": {
          "short": "Bus boarding is faster on average: its mean is about $30.69$ versus $31.51$ for Train, and its median is $30.65$ versus $31.5$. Bus times are more consistent: range $2.9$ versus $4.2$.",
          "worked": "The Bus mean is about $30.69$, below the Train mean of about $31.51$. Its median is also lower: $30.65$ compared with $31.5$. These lower times indicate that boarding a bus is generally faster.\n\nThe Bus range is $2.9$, below the Train range of $4.2$, so Bus boarding times are more consistent.",
